# Breaks R-2: everything a module exports carries full parameter and return
# types, because the signature is the whole of what a consumer reads. Drop the
# return type and there is nothing to write into the artifact, so the omission
# is refused where it is written rather than inferred from the body.
module diagnostics/r2_missing_return_type

pub def total(numbers : Array(Int32))
  numbers.sum
end

puts total([1, 2, 3])
